{'symbol': 'HPE', 'date': '2021-12-20 04:00:00', 'title': 'NTT WEST GROUP SELECTS HPE GREENLAKE TO LAUNCH NEW PORTFOLIO OF HYBRID CLOUD SERVICES', 'text': "TOKYO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--HEWLETT PACKARD ENTERPRISE (NYSE: HPE) TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT NTT BUSINESS SOLUTIONS, A MEMBER COMPANY OF NTT WEST GROUP, JAPAN'S LEADING NETWORK AND SYSTEM INTEGRATOR HAS SELECTED THE HPE GREENLAKE EDGE-TO-CLOUD PLATFORM TO DELIVER ITS GROWING ‘REGIONAL REVITALIZATION CLOUD' AND PROVIDE A HYBRID CLOUD SERVICE TO LOCAL GOVERNMENTS, EDUCATIONAL INSTITUTIONS AND BUSINESSES ACROSS WESTERN JAPAN. THE NEW HYBRID CLOUD SERVICE MEETS THE DEMANDS OF THEIR CUSTOMERS FOR ROBUST CLOU"}